  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: f7d4cbb5895136b46a86c7c41d13082b, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - Andromeda & Perseus
  - "A-\r\nI\u2019m in St. Louis! My eleventh and final task. As soon as I\u2019m
    done here, I\u2019ll head back to World\u2019s End. I can\u2019t believe we\u2019ll
    be together soon. It almost seems too good to be true. \r\n \r\nYou\u2019re absolutely
    killing it with those puzzles, by the way\u2014only Andromeda left! Did you know
    Andromeda and Perseus live happily ever after? I\u2019m pretty sure it\u2019s
    the only happy ending in all of Greek mythology. Everyone else\u2019s story ends
    badly. Hercules and Megara, Orpheus and Eurydice, Narcissus and Echo . . . and
    it\u2019s not just Greek myth, either. Look up Marie and Pierre Curie, and\u2026 
    \r\n\r\nI wrote to the Chicago Telegram again. They still won\u2019t print the
    story without more details. But I\u2019m not worried. Soon you\u2019ll solve
    that last puzzle and we\u2019ll get the word out. People will be able to watch
    the meteor storm with wonder, not fear. And you and I will watch the stars fall,
    together. (I know, technically they\u2019re meteors, not stars. But you know
    me. The hopeful romantic.)\r\n-E\r\n"
  StreamingVisuals:
  - VisualAssetPath: Postcards/andromeda.png
    LowResAssetPath: 
